fecundity.AddInfos:
Batch fecundity relationship (Ref. 4810).
North sector (north of 55°N): 41.33 x W;
Central sector (between 51° nd 55°N): 45.72 x W;
South sector (south of 51°N): 55.49 x W.
Over-all batch fecundity relationship for the three areas: 53.05 x W.
Number of spawnings per season may reach 30 in this area (Ref. 4810). Furthermore, batch size decreases with increasing latitude (Ref. 4810).

